Error [E0119]: `{ … }` needs a known struct type here
  --> tests/ui/list_literal_ambiguous_dot.jet:9:18
    |
  9 |     fighters :: [{name: "Ada", hp: 10}, {name: "Bo", hp: 8}]
    |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The inferred construction form requires an expected type from the surrounding context (binding annotation, return type, etc.)
 Fix: Name the type at the value, e.g. `x :: Point{x: 1, y: 2}`, or inside a list `[Point{ … }, { … }]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0119

